message: "If you use this proof, please cite it as below."
title: "Six unit squares cannot cover a square of side greater than 2"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhou
    given-names: Ningyu
    email: zhouningyu27@gmail.com
    affiliation: "School of Physics, Peking University"
