version: "1.0.0"
type: software
license: "LicenseRef-Mixed"
url: "https://github.com/ZhouNingyu327/S6-eq-2"
abstract: >-
  Computer-assisted proof that S(6)=2 (equivalently Π(2)=7), resolving the
  conjecture of Dósa–Lángi–Tuza. Independent peer review and a full Lean
  re-proof of every metric inequality are not claimed.
keywords:
  - unit square covering
  - S(n)
  - computer-assisted proof
  - Lean 4
